r separate needs.\nWhat can be checked: in the linked contract files, what was bought in each case and on which dates, and whether several contracts meet a single need that could have been procured at once.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"plantilla","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["Ope2BfpbZHc%2FbjW6njtWLw%3D%3D","sW4sCB7Kd8ysNfRW6APEDw%3D%3D","qoRtljt%2FzUnpxJFXpLZ%2B2A%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-16"}}